In ls(paste("package:", BSgenome.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg19)) :
   'paste("package:", BSgenome.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg19)' converted to character string

but not if I do

 > ls(paste("package:", "BSgenome.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg19", sep=""))
[1] "BSgenome.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg19" "Hsapiens"

I think Steve tried to point this out in an earlier message; see also the 
vignette and help page for MEDIPS.createSet.

