>> Now I have a question: when I use readGAlignmentsList() to read in the pairs, how can I preserve the order of the two reads, i.e., keep read 1 as the first alignment and  read 2 as the second alignment in a element (with two alignments) of the alignments list? is it the default order of each element of the list?
