>>>
>>>       > table(mcols(galist1)$mate_status)
>>>
>>>           mated ambiguous   unmated
>>>           75346         0     21286
>>>
>>> As you can see, another change is that this field is now a 3-level
>>> factor (levels are explained in ?readGAlignmentsList).
