If you must absolutely use 'R CMD INSTALL' to install packages, you
should do it on the package source tarballs, not on the source tree.
The source tree can contain stalled .o or .so files that will only
cause problems. So:

   R CMD INSTALL IRanges_1.22.3.tar.gz
   R CMD INSTALL XVector_0.4.0.tar.gz

in *that* order.

