Dear Jesus,

The error message seems reasonably self explanatory.

The data needs to have replicate samples (i.e., there should be more 
microarrays than there are columns to the design matrix), otherwise it is 
impossible to estimate variability or to do any statistical tests.

This is a basic requirement of any statistical analysis, even a simple 
univariate t-test.

Your data appears to have no replicates.

Best wishes
Gordon

