Dear Shirley,

I don't think that scaling in prcomp() is appropriate here.

Better would be:

  library(edgeR)
  dge <- DGEList(counts=count)
  dge <- calcNormFactors(dge)
  logCPM <- cpm(dge,log=TRUE,prior.count=5)
  plotMDS(logCPM)
  logCPM <- removeBatchEffect(logCPM,batch=batch)
  plotMDS(logCPM)

Best wishes
Gordon


